### Use an HTTP client supporting .http variables. Replace token/IDs after each create.
@base = http://localhost:8080/api
@token = REPLACE_WITH_TOKEN
@courseId = 1
@topicId = REPLACE_WITH_TOPIC_ID
@slotId = REPLACE_WITH_SLOT_ID
@bookingId = REPLACE_WITH_BOOKING_ID

### Register an instructor; use a different email for a student account
POST {{base}}/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{"name":"Sita Teacher","email":"teacher@example.com","password":"ChooseYourPassword123!","role":"instructor"}

### Login
POST {{base}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{"email":"teacher@example.com","password":"ChooseYourPassword123!"}

### Current account
GET {{base}}/auth/me
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Create a free published course (instructor token)
POST {{base}}/instructor/courses
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"title":"Nepali Conversation","description":"Practice everyday conversations.","category":"Languages","subcategory":"Nepali","price":0,"level":"BEGINNER","durationHours":2,"emoji":"📚","accent":"teal","published":true}

### Browse
GET {{base}}/courses?category=Languages&page=0&size=20

### Create a topic
POST {{base}}/instructor/courses/{{courseId}}/topics
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"title":"Foundations","position":0}

### Create a PDF lesson; upload binary separately through multipart field file
POST {{base}}/instructor/topics/{{topicId}}/lessons
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"title":"Greetings handout","minutes":10,"kind":"pdf","duration":0,"chapters":[],"position":0}

### Enroll with a student token
PUT {{base}}/me/enrollments/{{courseId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Save teacher profile
PUT {{base}}/live-classes/teacher
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"subject":"Languages","bio":"I teach conversational Nepali.","languages":"Nepali, English"}

### Discover slots; create availability using a future epoch millisecond start first
GET {{base}}/live-classes/slots

### Book with another user's token
POST {{base}}/live-classes/bookings
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"slotId":"{{slotId}}","goals":"Practice conversation","timezone":"Asia/Kathmandu"}

### Participant message
POST {{base}}/live-classes/bookings/{{bookingId}}/messages
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"text":"Looking forward to class!"}

### Logout
POST {{base}}/auth/logout
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
